{"projectInfo":{"name":"双机IRFNAT配置实验","path":"twonat","visibility":2,"categoryId":150,"introduction":"内网主机192.168.10.1和内网服务器10.1.1.1网关均在核心交换机上，核心交换机相连的接口地址分别为192.168.10.2、10.1.1.2。核心交换机上行是出口防火墙F1090，F1090做IRF，与交换机之前通过三层聚合口6相连，三层聚合口6地址为172.31.1.1，公网口G1/0/2加入三层聚合口5，地址为61.1.1.1。出口防火墙公网口与外部交换机通过三层聚合口5相连，三层聚合口5地址未61.1.1.1，外部交换机与公网服务器11.1.1.2相连。要求：（1）内网主机需要通过出口防火墙做动态NAT转换去访问公网服务器，要求使用公网地址61.1.1.3作为动态地址池地址。（2）出口防火墙上做一条nat server的映射（61.1.1.4:5456映射内网服务器10.1.1.1:23），使得公网可以访问内网服务器的23端口。","label":[]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"内网服务器","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\内网服务器.cfg"},{"resourceName":"公网服务器","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\公网服务器.cfg"},{"resourceName":"主机","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\主机.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW1","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW2","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"FW1","resourceCategory":"防火墙","resourceModel":"F1090","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-A7164","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\FW1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"FW2","resourceCategory":"防火墙","resourceModel":"F1090","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-A7164","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\FW2.cfg"}]}